1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
It requires a lot, how so?

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,520
When I'm in a relationship with a person

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,880
Or when I marry a woman

4
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,160
I marry her past

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,160
Her childhood

6
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:13,160
Her upbringing by her family

7
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,160
I marry her fears

8
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:19,360
When I relate to a friend, I relate with his defects

9
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,000
I relate with his needs

10
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,360
I relate with his unachieved hopes

11
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,160
I relate with the rough edges in his personality

12
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:29,200
Which I'm not required to refine

13
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:34,080
So, I don't relate with a person that's just positive, amazing and successful

14
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,640
no, I am connected to their legacy

15
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:41,040
And in order to live with this person, I, too, have a heritage

16
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:43,600
I have my own fears, hopes and ambitions

17
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:47,280
And I have my own standards, my failures and successes

18
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,120
And how I don't want to repeat them

19
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:51,240
But what governs this relationship?
